    "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nDiscourse sites allowing passwordless login or email-code activation are susceptible to a race condition that could allow an attacker to claim account privileges associated with an email address they do not own.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nDisable the \"Enable local logins via code\" upcoming change.\r\n\r\n<!-- patch-triage-lifecycle:7fb45bff786cae3cc39d950d7b7808100b7d1593583efa58b0d2d04b8f1bccd6 -->\n\nDiscovered by Anthropic's OSS Scanner, as vulnerability ANT-2026-L95YKBZU.",
